{"id":"nli7mvp931kmok6s3cj3y25zq","title":"宇宙的本质是存在！存在定义宇宙结构和格局！","originalTitle":"什么是存在一一存在是宇宙的本质！存在是宇宙结构和格局！存在就是宇宙！","summary":"本文提出了“存在”的新定义，即宇宙不动点及其决定的一切。不动点是宇宙广延性和持续性流逝的定点不变规定，决定了一切宇宙存在。这一定义解决了哲学和认知上的历史疑难，为物理存在和宇宙本质提供了新的视角。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3400625&do=blog&id=1560160"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T09:55:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T15:04:13.598Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T15:04:13.598Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":18,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b3a99bdf-a186-49d1-97b0-d88367e75f9c","title":"邵亮团队提出宇宙不动点定义存在新理论"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b3a99bdf-a186-49d1-97b0-d88367e75f9c","title":"邵亮团队提出宇宙不动点定义存在新理论"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fVweMCH0CgwU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}